# Level 25, reached by password GYLM, then the *heavy weapon* collected and
# fired at the boss.
#
# **This is the first input in the project that fires a weapon the boss rewrites.**
# `$82:9660` answers four ids as some other id, and `boss_remap_61` -- `$61`
# always answered as `$60` -- had read zero on every movie ever recorded, because
# no input had ever held anything but the squirt gun on this level.
#
# The route is the level's own geometry and it took three findings to walk.
# **The start is the top of an escalator**, which pushes the player back up the
# moment Down is released, so the first leg has to be held through; that is also
# why `tools/fit_route.py` cannot fit this route -- it plans a leg, releases,
# measures, and measures itself back where it started, 48 legs running. **The two
# objects the router likes are inside scenery** (the `$16` at (1243,505) is in a
# display case, the `$06` at (989,122) in a water feature) and it says so
# correctly. What is reachable is four `$26` objects: two at (1081,288) in the
# north plaza and one each at (700,650) and (550,700) in the central one.
#
# Object type `$26` is collision id `$11` (`$80:CA30`), which is inventory slot 5
# (`$80:F87B`), which is weapon `$61` -- checked with `--records`, which shows
# every shot reading `$61` from frame 3300. `$80:F8AC` says a pickup is **five
# shots**, which is why all four are collected and why the B press is at 3900,
# with the boss forty pixels away.
#
# What it buys: `boss_remap_61`, and thirty of the boss's seventy health --
# 70 -> 66 -> 58 -> 50 -> 46 -> 45 -> 43 -> 42 -> 41 -> 40, read off
# `zamn_headless --watch 083C`. It does **not** kill it; `boss_died` is still
# untaken and `docs/cosim.md` prices what would.
#
# Retune by watching the health word rather than the picture:
#   zamn_headless <rom> shot.png 7600 -m movies\level25-boss.zmv --watch 083C,3900,7580,1
